==Battleground==
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 8~16 seconds<sup>240f~480f</sup>.
*3 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 1~16 seconds<sup>30f~480f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns.

==Strategy==
It is recommended to save up money and level up your [[Worker Cat]] before going in for the attack. When you are done saving up, this stage is quite simple. Just use some [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] cats for Sir Seal and One Horn such as [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Swordsman Cat]] or [[Viking Cat (Rare Cat)|Viking Cat]]. To deal with Master A., use tanky units to damage him such as [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]] or [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Titan Cat]]. Using the same strategy from the last stage is useful if you add [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] to it.

